\description{
\code{\link[=createDataPackage]{createDataPackage()}} compiles data from \code{\link[=extractDbData]{extractDbData()}} into
a standardised MR1 data package for one radar campaign, following the
\href{https://datapackage.org}{Frictionless Data Package} standard. Time range,
pulse type, rotation, echo class, class probability, altitude and echo
validator filters are applied with \code{\link[=filterProtocolData]{filterProtocolData()}} and
\code{\link[=filterEchoData]{filterEchoData()}}.

The package contains five tabular resources: \code{echo_data}, \code{protocol_data},
\code{blind_times}, \code{sunrise_sunset} and \code{site_data}. Each resource has a Table
Schema with field types, descriptions, units, and primary and foreign keys.
\code{echo_data} contains all echo columns, except those that are obsolete or
redundant: \code{mtr_factor_old}, \code{statistical_classification_old},
\code{classification_id} and \code{sphere_dia} (old classification, outdated since
